msgid "Obtain X-Ray Scanner.\n"
msgstr "Obtain X-Ray Scanner.\n"

#. L_LIP_070
msgid "\n"
msgstr "\n"

#. L_LIP_071
msgid "X-Ray Scanner\n"
msgstr "Ｘスキャン\n"

#. L_LIP_072
msgid "X-Ray Scanner\n"
msgstr "Ｘスキャン\n"

#. L_LIP_073
msgid "Picked up X-Ray Scanner.\n"
msgstr "Ｘスキャンを手に入れた\n"

#. L_LIP_074
msgid "Scanner target acquired.\n"
msgstr "スキャナーがターゲットをロックした\n"

#. L_LIP_075
msgid "Target ID confirmed - XT origin.\n"
msgstr "ターゲットＩＤ確認　生命反応なし\n"

#. L_LIP_076
msgid "Scanner lock lost.\n"
msgstr "スキャナーのロックが失われた\n"

#. L_LIP_077
msgid "Disguise has been worn.\n"
msgstr "ユニフォームを着用した\n"

#. L_LIP_078
msgid ""
"The showers... Now, if I can convince someone \n"
"to part with their uniform...\n"
msgstr ""
"ふーん、シャワー室か。そうそう、\n"
"ここになら、ユニフォームがあるかも…\n"

#. L_LIP_079
msgid ""
"The temperature's dropping... You must be \n"
"close to the cryo room.\n"
msgstr ""
"温度が下がってきているようだ。\n"
"冷凍カプセルは近いぞ！\n"

#. L_LIP_080
msgid ""
"The air's heavily recycled around here - must\n"
" be near the autopsy lab.\n"
msgstr ""
"エチルアルコールのにおい…。\n"
"医学実験室はこの近くね。\n"

#. L_LIP_081
msgid "There he is, Jo! Hurry or you'll be too late!\n"
msgstr ""
"よーしここだ、ジョアンナ！\n"
"急がないと手遅れになるぞ！\n"

#. L_LIP_082
msgid "Leave this area now.\n"
msgstr "オイ！勝手に入るんじゃない！\n"

#. L_LIP_083
msgid "Should you be in here?\n"
msgstr "ここの担当か？\n"

#. L_LIP_084
msgid "Holy...\n"
msgstr "お、お前は…\n"

#. L_LIP_085
msgid "It's a spy!\n"
msgstr "こいつ、スパイだ！\n"

#. L_LIP_086
msgid "Warn the others...\n"
msgstr "アラームを！\n"

#. L_LIP_087
msgid "Imposter!\n"
msgstr "何者だ！\n"

#. L_LIP_088
msgid "Lighting systems overloaded.\n"
msgstr "照明システムがオーバーロードした\n"

#. L_LIP_089
msgid "Alternative entrance to medlabs created.\n"
msgstr "もう一つの方法で侵入ルートを作った\n"

#. L_LIP_090
msgid ""
"The problem you have is that there is no \n"
"way to sneak into the research section. \n"
"The only way in available to you is a \n"
"weak section of wall I've marked in the \n"
"room beyond the stores. It can be destroyed \n"
"with explosives.\n"
msgstr ""
"この先に侵入するには\n"
"壁を壊すしかない。\n"
"p倉庫の奥のモロい所に\n"
"マークをつけておいた。\n"
"p爆破して侵入するんだ。\n"

#. L_LIP_091
msgid ""
"Doesn't sound like a problem to me. Where \n"
"are these explosives?\n"
msgstr ""
"全く問題ないわ。ところで\n"
"「爆薬」はどこにあるの？\n"

#. L_LIP_092
msgid "In that crate.\n"
msgstr "このコンテナの中さ。\n"

#. L_LIP_093
msgid "Cute. Very cute.\n"
msgstr "ふ～ん、なかなかキュートじゃない。\n"

#. L_LIP_094
msgid ""
"By the way, the stores are crawling with \n"
"guards. It may go against your nature, but \n"
"try sneaking through rather than blasting \n"
"everything.\n"
msgstr ""
"倉庫には警備兵がウジャウジャいる。\n"
"p何でも撃ちまくるんじゃなくて\n"
"静かに潜入するんだ、いいな。\n"

#. L_LIP_095
msgid "Certainly. Any other pearls of wisdom?\n"
msgstr ""
"はいはい。\n"
"他に「オ・コ・ト・バ」はあって？\n"

#. L_LIP_096
msgid "That crate...\n"
msgstr "うん？　このコンテナだが…\n"

#. L_LIP_097
msgid "Yes?\n"
msgstr "な～に？\n"

#. L_LIP_098
msgid "It really doesn't like being shot.\n"
msgstr "コイツは撃たれるのがキライらしいぜ。\n"

#. L_LIP_099
msgid ""
"Great. Now, if I can just fight the urge \n"
"to report him to Base Security...\n"
msgstr ""
"なによ！　エラそうに…。\n"
"警備兵にチクッてやろうかしら…\n"

#. L_LIP_100
msgid ""
"Put your hands up and step away from the \n"
"alien.\n"
msgstr ""
"手を上げて！\n"
"そこから離れなさい！\n"

#. L_LIP_101
msgid ""
"What the hell do you think you're doing? \n"
"This is supposed to be a sealed room! \n"
"Don't you know anything about autopsy \n"
"procedures?\n"
msgstr ""
"一体何のマネだ？　ここは\n"
"超極秘エリアなんだぞ！！\n"
"p検死の手続きを知らないのか！\n"

#. L_LIP_102
msgid ""
"Don't make me tell you again, Doctor. And \n"
"turn that laser off.\n"
msgstr ""
"何度も言わせないで！\n"
"さっさとレーザーを切るのよ！\n"

#. L_LIP_103
msgid ""
"Director Easton will hear about this, \n"
"young lady.\n"
msgstr ""
"イーストン司令にバレたら\n"
"タダでは済まないぞ！\n"

#. L_LIP_104
msgid ""
"Of course he's going to hear of it, you \n"
"moron. I've just got into his top secret \n"
"base, and now I'm stealing his alien.\n"
msgstr ""
"ええ、もちろん聞くことになるでしょうよ。\n"
"私が超極秘の基地に潜入して、エイリアンを\n"
"を盗んだってことをね。\n"

#. L_LIP_105
msgid "Automatic Defenses Disabled.\n"
msgstr "自動警備システムを破壊した\n"
